<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Personal</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>personal &lt;player&gt; &lt;item&gt;
</pre>
<p>Example:
</p>
<pre>load sticker@wiz
personal Fizban anklet
</pre>
<p>Makes an item belong to one player for good. It isn't a command of its 
own: it works while you carry a sticker (load sticker@wiz). The item 
must be with you and the player in the same room.
</p><p>The item is refitted to the player's size ("... now belongs and is 
refitted to ..."), and from then on:
</p>
<ul><li>only its owner may hold it: anyone else is shocked and drops it, and loses half their hit points if they were wearing it (gods above level 220 aside);</li>
<li>it stays with its owner when they die, and appears before them again once they are back in the world.</li></ul>
<p>Keep it for special items, such as prizes from a competition. Every use 
is logged. A mortal who gets hold of a sticker and uses it loses 16000 
experience, and the item and the sticker are destroyed.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Wizhelp Load</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Wizhelp Competition</a>
</pre>




</div>